			"notes": "RecursiveCraft v0.84-fix for Minecraft 1.20.1\n\n  Changed\n\n  - Switched default mod metadata to English for international release packaging.\n  - Improved missing-material diagnostics for target-output and NBT-sensitive recursive crafting paths.\n\n  Fixed\n\n  - Fixed missing-material/debug text so item names and NBT summaries are shown as readable player-facing text instead\n    of internal component structures.\n\n  - Expanded regression coverage for target output, NBT matching, shared resource shortages, and transaction calculation\n    cases."
		},
